                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].WHLocation)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].WHLocationID)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].PackingType)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].PackingTypeID)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].DecPackages)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].DecPieces)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].DecWeight)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].RecPackages)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].RecPieces)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].RecWeight)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].OutPackages)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].OutPieces)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].OutWeight)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].CLPPackages)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].CLPPieces)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].CLPWeight)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].BalPackages)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].BalPieces)

                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].BalWeight)


                                            @Html.HiddenFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].YearID)

                                        </td>

                                        <td>   @Html.DisplayFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].CargoName)</td>
                                        <td>   @Html.DisplayFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].SpaceCertificateNo)</td>
                                        <td>   @Html.DisplayFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].NOCDate)</td>
                                        <td>   @Html.DisplayFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].TruckContNo)</td>
                                        <td>   @Html.DisplayFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].trnDestuffingDate)</td>
                                        <td>   @Html.DisplayFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].WHLocation)</td>
                                        <td>   @Html.DisplayFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].PackingType)</td>
                                        <td>   @Html.DisplayFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].DecPackages)</td>
                                        <td>   @Html.DisplayFor(m => Model.lsttrnCargoRepackingItems[i].DecPieces)</td>
